re filed by the Member under subsections 14(3), 15(1) and 21(3); (e) list the positions and corporations, trade or professional associations and trade unions disclosed under paragraph 21(1)(e); and (f) list any trusts disclosed under paragraph 21(1)(b.1). Claude DeBellefeuille · Member of Parliament Declaration type Disclosure Summaries (Code) Disclosure date January 26, 2026 Regime Conflict of Interest Code for Members of the House of Commons Description LiabilitiesMortgage with Desjardins, with spouseSpouse's/Common-Law Partner's source(s) of incomeLast and next 12 months:Employment income from Imprimerie Scripto Inc. Disclosed on January 26, 2026","url":"https://www.ethicscanada.ca/en/public-registry/Details?declarationId=0d383f58-b075-456e-b8f0-6f47ec60a188"}],"other":[]},"lobbying":{"total":97,"first":"2010-10-26","last":"2026-09-10","byYear":{"2010":2,"2011":6,"2020":5,"2021":8,"2022":9,"2023":7,"2024":17,"2025":12,"2026":31},"topSubjects":[["Health",12],["Agriculture",10],["International Trade",8],["Transportation",8],["Environment",8],["Industry",7],["Internal Trade",7],["Labour",6]],"topOrgs":[["Chamber of Marine Commerce",7],["DIAGEO Canada Inc.",4],["Canadian Labour Congress",3],["Unifor",3],["Diageo Canada",3],["Canadian Association of Professional Employees",3],["Canadian Medical Association",2],["Canadian Produce Marketing Association",2]]}}